    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i know i should get help but help doesn't change the fact that i'm constantly drowning. it's just... it's so selfish to keep staying when i know i'm just dragging them down with me. it feels like i'm just prolonging their struggle by being here. wouldn't it be more selfless to just... let them go and be free of me?",
